cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Climate TRACE Emissions Methodology
message: >-
  If you use the Climate TRACE dataset or this repository as a whole,
  please cite it as below. If you use data from a specific sector
  methodology, please cite it using the "Data citation format" provided
  in each methodology's README or pdf.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: Climate TRACE Coalition
    website: https://climatetrace.org
abstract: >-
  Methodology documents, changelogs, and archived methodologies describing
  how Climate TRACE estimates greenhouse gas and non-greenhouse gas emissions
  across sectors using satellite observations, remote sensing, and AI.
repository-code: https://github.com/climatetracecoalition/emissions-methodology
url: https://climatetrace.org/approach
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: no version number since sector version varies. Use access date instead. 
keywords:
  - greenhouse gas emissions
  - emissions methodology
  - remote sensing
  - MRV
  - climate data
  - open data
